[ar:keshi]
[ti:Night]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : Jacob Ray/Elie Rizk/Yiorgos Karaminas/Casey Luong/Imad Royal/Patrick “J. Que” Smith
[00:01.00]作曲 : Jacob Ray/Elie Rizk/Yiorgos Karaminas/Casey Luong/Imad Royal/Patrick “J. Que” Smith
[00:08.17]Hard to breathe
[00:08.17]窒息般压抑
[00:10.47]Every move I make I feel them watching me
[00:10.47]举步维艰 窥视的目光如芒在背
[00:15.15]Try to run away but I can't
[00:15.15]欲逃不能 好似困兽犹斗
[00:17.62]Seem to make a sound
[00:17.62]声嘶力竭
[00:22.34]But I keep screaming out
[00:22.34]却发不出丝毫声响
[00:26.89]All my body, all the rest, I
[00:26.89]我倾尽所有 身心俱献
[00:31.51]Gave it up and all that's left is you
[00:31.51]舍弃种种 只留下一个你
[00:38.96]Try to reach but I can't move
[00:38.96]想触及你 却寸步难行
[00:44.85]Yeah, ooh
[00:47.77]Waiting for the light
[00:47.77]静候光明
[00:52.42]I can't close my eyes
[00:52.42]阖不上双眼
[00:57.36]When I'm alone I hear it calling
[00:57.36]剩我一人 便听到呼唤
[01:01.40]So save me from the night
[01:01.40]那么请救赎我 抽身于无尽黑夜
[01:05.04]Save me
[01:05.04]请救赎我
[01:07.29]Oh, give me the light
[01:07.29]噢 赐予我光明
